  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 0.82,
      "end_time_s": 4.47,
      "duration_s": 3.65,
      "text": "The silence out here is heavy. Like it has weight.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 4.79,
      "end_time_s": 7.3,
      "duration_s": 2.51,
      "text": "It’s the absence of noise that makes the mind loud.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 7.58,
      "end_time_s": 12.7,
      "duration_s": 5.12,
      "text": "I remember reading that time isn’t linear, just a stack of memories.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 13.27,
      "end_time_s": 16.15,
      "duration_s": 2.88,
      "text": "But what if we’re just echoes in a cave?",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 16.6,
      "end_time_s": 20.38,
      "duration_s": 3.78,
      "text": "An echo needs a source. Where does the sound begin?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 20.54,
      "end_time_s": 24.06,
      "duration_s": 3.52,
      "text": "Maybe the source is the listener. We create the meaning.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 24.5,
      "end_time_s": 28.03,
      "duration_s": 3.53,
      "text": "That’s comforting, or terrifying. I can’t decide.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 28.28,
      "end_time_s": 32.01,
      "duration_s": 3.73,
      "text": "Look at the stars. They are dead light. We see the past.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 32.58,
      "end_time_s": 36.1,
      "duration_s": 3.52,
      "text": "Dysacousia makes the world feel muffled, like underwater.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 36.49,
      "end_time_s": 39.88,
      "duration_s": 3.39,
      "text": "Is it like listening to a symphony through a wall?",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 40.33,
      "end_time_s": 43.41,
      "duration_s": 3.08,
      "text": "Exactly. You feel the vibration but miss the melody.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 43.97,
      "end_time_s": 47.33,
      "duration_s": 3.36,
      "text": "It makes me wonder if we miss the melody of existence.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 47.69,
      "end_time_s": 51.17,
      "duration_s": 3.48,
      "text": "I used to sketch on my drawboard until dawn.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 51.48,
      "end_time_s": 53.38,
      "duration_s": 1.9,
      "text": "Did you capture the feeling of the night?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "interruption",
      "start_time_s": 52.8,
      "end_time_s": 55.96,
      "duration_s": 3.16,
      "text": "Or did you just trace the shadows?",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 56.47,
      "end_time_s": 58.85,
      "duration_s": 2.38,
      "text": "I tried to draw the shape of silence.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 59.16,
      "end_time_s": 61.75,
      "duration_s": 2.59,
      "text": "A bilobed shape, perhaps? Like a wing?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 62.17,
      "end_time_s": 64.65,
      "duration_s": 2.48,
      "text": "Or a lung, breathing in the dark.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 65.12,
      "end_time_s": 67.67,
      "duration_s": 2.55,
      "text": "Maybe we are just breathing in the dark.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 67.85,
      "end_time_s": 69.96,
      "duration_s": 2.11,
      "text": "And hoping someone hears us.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 70.36,
      "end_time_s": 73.13,
      "duration_s": 2.77,
      "text": "Let’s hope the echo is strong enough.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 73.71,
      "end_time_s": 80.13,
      "duration_s": 6.42,
      "text": "I was thinking about how memory works. It’s not a recording, it’s more like a reconstruction.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 80.57,
      "end_time_s": 84.26,
      "duration_s": 3.69,
      "text": "Every time you recall something, you’re actually rewriting it.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 84.53,
      "end_time_s": 89.74,
      "duration_s": 5.21,
      "text": "Like an artist on a worn-out drawboard, erasing and redrawing the same scene.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 90.07,
      "end_time_s": 95.88,
      "duration_s": 5.8,
      "text": "Exactly. And over time, the original image is barely visible beneath the layers.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 96.17,
      "end_time_s": 98.93,
      "duration_s": 2.76,
      "text": "But what if the original was always flawed?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 99.36,
      "end_time_s": 103.95,
      "duration_s": 4.59,
      "text": "Then the reconstruction is just as valid. Maybe even more honest.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 104.12,
      "end_time_s": 108.39,
      "duration_s": 4.27,
      "text": "I’ve been having trouble remembering the melody of a song from my childhood.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 108.9,
      "end_time_s": 113.28,
      "duration_s": 4.38,
      "text": "Dysacousia. That’s what they call it when the brain can’t process the pitch correctly.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 113.82,
      "end_time_s": 119.36,
      "duration_s": 5.54,
      "text": "It’s strange, isn’t it? The sound is there, but the meaning gets lost in translation.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 119.73,
      "end_time_s": 123.4,
      "duration_s": 3.67,
      "text": "Or maybe the meaning was never really there to begin with.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 123.91,
      "end_time_s": 126.73,
      "duration_s": 2.82,
      "text": "Just noise we convinced ourselves was music.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 126.89,
      "end_time_s": 132.94,
      "duration_s": 6.05,
      "text": "Like the way the wind sounds through the trees. Is it a whisper or just friction?",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 133.41,
      "end_time_s": 136.08,
      "duration_s": 2.67,
      "text": "It doesn’t matter. The feeling remains.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 136.65,
      "end_time_s": 139.1,
      "duration_s": 2.45,
      "text": "The feeling is the only thing that’s real.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.27,
        4.07,
        1.65
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 139.63,
      "end_time_s": 141.63,
      "duration_s": 2.0,
      "text": "Then let’s listen to the noise.",
      "speaker_position": [
        1.42,
        3.49,
        1.15
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.34
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "en",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 142.05,
      "end_time_s": 143.75,
      "duration_s": 1.7,
      "text": "And let it be enough.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.61,
        2.38,
        1.75
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    }
